graph LR
  Q[User Query]
  Q -->|raw text| Normalize[Query Normalization\n(clean / tokenize)]
  Normalize -->|clean text| EmbedReq[Embedding Request]
  EmbedReq -->|vector request| EmbedAPI[Embedding API\n(LLM Provider)]
  EmbedAPI -->|vector| VSearch[Vector Search (Chroma)]
  VSearch -->|ids + scores| Candidate[Candidate Passages]
  Candidate -->|assemble context| Scoring[Scoring & Context Build]
  Scoring -->|prompt| Prompt[Prompt Template]
  Prompt -->|call| LLM[LLM Invocation]
  LLM -->|answer| Post[Post-process & Cache]
  Post -->|formatted answer| Return[Return Answer to Client]
  LLM -.->|if unavailable| Fallback[Fallback: cached answer / helpful error]
  Fallback --> Return
  Post -->|cache| ClientCache[(Extension Cache / localStorage)]
  VSearch -->|read / write| VectorDB((Vector DB\nchroma.sqlite3))
